cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BUDGET-MAPF: learned communication in decentralised Multi-Agent Path Finding"
abstract: >-
  A controlled study of learned inter-agent communication for decentralised
  MAPF. A shuffled-message control holds the communication module, its
  parameter count and its compute fixed while destroying the correspondence
  between sender and message, separating the value of the information from
  the capacity of the module.
